WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.979
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind setting bookmarks.

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:10.733
Theme: changes the appearance of a browser. Bookmark: saves a useful page link.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:17.219
Default search engine: is the service a browser uses for searches. Cookies: are small

00:00:17.219 --> 00:00:22.093
pieces of information stored by sites. Settings: control how the browser behaves.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.686
Use an imaginary example or a teacher-approved offline screenshot. Discuss when to

00:00:27.686 --> 00:00:33.606
use theme and bookmark. Never enter a real password or share private details in this

00:00:33.606 --> 00:00:34.001
activity.
